WEBVTT

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.970
Long ago, there existed
a brilliant young scientist.

00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:16.060
By dint of his astonishing genius,

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:19.060
he was able to make a number of
contributions to human knowledge.

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:28.090
However, eventually he became
disillusioned with the world.

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:34.960
Though constantly showered with
praise for the subtlety of his mind,

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:39.910
none of his ideas or
theories ever received

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:42.920
even the slightest support
from the scientific community.

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:47.780
"We should not be striving
to advance human civilization,

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:51.070
but rather the artificial
evolution of humans as a species."

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:55.090
That was the only dream he ever had.

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:58.840
But not a single person came forward
to help him fulfill that dream.

00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:01.450
Damn these apes!

00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:05.360
"Dangerous ideas?"
Writing about me as if I were some freak?

00:01:06.070 --> 00:01:10.620
Do they really think humans have come
this far by avoiding risks?

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:15.520
Idiots who think
they no longer need to evolve

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:18.320
have no right to pass on their genes!

00:01:18.810 --> 00:01:22.520
Of course, this plan was always
for my own sake.

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:25.740
I will carry it out...
even if I must do it all myself!

00:01:29.580 --> 00:01:32.430
Thereafter, he devoted himself to research.

00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:36.950
It was only after he turned 70
that his efforts began to yield results.

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:48.150
First, the scientist regained his youth.

00:01:48.700 --> 00:01:52.370
Next, he began cloning himself.

00:01:53.390 --> 00:01:57.150
He named his laboratory
the "House of Evolution"

00:01:57.400 --> 00:01:59.020
and together with his clones

00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:03.860
he conducted countless experiments
with animals to create new species.

00:02:04.350 --> 00:02:07.140
Eventually, his experiments shifted to
human subjects—

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:08.500
This is taking too long!

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:09.180
...eh?

00:02:09.830 --> 00:02:11.500
What's this got to do with me?

00:02:11.690 --> 00:02:13.520
You're just trying to act cool again.

00:02:15.320 --> 00:02:18.080
Just get to the point, okay?

00:02:18.470 --> 00:02:22.640
My master is a busy man.
Summarize it in 20 words or less.

00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:26.830
...I-I'm sorry.

00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:05.910
So, in other words, my boss has become
very curious about your body.

00:04:06.920 --> 00:04:09.210
I'm not interested in dudes.

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:11.160
I think you misunderstood, Master.

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:15.420
He plans to use your body,
which surpasses normal human limitations,

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:18.750
for his research on evolution.

00:04:19.890 --> 00:04:23.420
If we don't do something,
I'm sure he'll try again.

00:04:24.120 --> 00:04:26.060
We cannot allow him a free hand.

00:04:26.690 --> 00:04:28.570
Our move should be to attack him.

00:04:30.340 --> 00:04:32.220
Sure, let's go.

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:33.270
Okay.

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:36.380
Huh?

00:04:36.810 --> 00:04:37.590
Now?!

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:41.780
Yeah, there's a sale on tomorrow.
Can't do it then.

00:04:42.180 --> 00:04:43.180
Master!

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:44.780
This doesn't sound good.

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:46.680
Better tell the Doctor...

00:04:47.560 --> 00:04:48.580
Hey, you.

00:04:48.580 --> 00:04:49.650
Oh. Yes?

00:04:49.870 --> 00:04:51.400
I have one last question.

00:04:51.740 --> 00:04:56.340
Was the "House of Evolution" developing
cyborgs prior to four years ago?

00:04:56.920 --> 00:04:58.150
How many more cyborgs are there?

00:04:58.570 --> 00:05:01.010
Have any of them destroyed towns
in the past?

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:03.180
I'm not sure,

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:06.730
but at the "House of Evolution,"
I'm the only combat cyborg.

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:11.340
Impossible!

00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:15.880
Our elite force, formed for the extermination
of these obsolete humans, wiped out?!

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:21.160
According to Armored Gorilla's report,
the two responsible are on their way here.

00:05:24.070 --> 00:05:25.890
If they come,

00:05:26.190 --> 00:05:30.100
all our research, everything we've been
working on, could be destroyed.

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:32.390
This is a serious matter.

00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:36.790
The only option is to use our trump card.

00:05:38.570 --> 00:05:41.640
Begin preparations for the release of
Asura Kabuto.

00:05:42.760 --> 00:05:43.370
What?!

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:45.220
-No, not him!
-That's crazy!

00:05:45.760 --> 00:05:48.730
-He'll finally be released?
-He's right. That might be the only way.

00:05:48.750 --> 00:05:51.330
-But maybe we should stop him.
-It's too dangerous.

00:05:51.510 --> 00:05:53.250
-I have a bad feeling about this.
-Is that the only way?

00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:54.330
Be calm!

00:05:54.570 --> 00:05:56.230
He will be our last resort.

00:05:57.150 --> 00:05:58.110
But...

00:05:58.880 --> 00:06:02.830
First, from the first to the eighth floor,
we'll activate all our traps.

00:06:03.230 --> 00:06:05.310
If we're lucky, they will take care of
the intruders.

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:08.990
I'm fully aware of what will happen to me

00:06:10.040 --> 00:06:11.380
should we fail.

00:06:14.490 --> 00:06:17.220
I didn't think we'd be running
the whole way.

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:18.760
How else are we gonna get there?

00:06:19.290 --> 00:06:22.630
I was sure you could fly or something.

00:06:22.760 --> 00:06:24.720
Humans can't fly, you know.

00:06:25.560 --> 00:06:27.470
It's amazing that you are never late.

00:06:27.930 --> 00:06:29.430
As expected from a hero.

00:06:29.540 --> 00:06:32.560
Nah, I hardly ever arrive on time.

00:06:35.280 --> 00:06:36.310
We're here.

00:06:36.990 --> 00:06:38.830
This is the place Gorilla told us of.

00:06:40.190 --> 00:06:41.210
So this is...

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:42.790
...the "House of Evolution."

00:06:43.730 --> 00:06:49.370
One, two, three, four, five, six...
Looks like it's about eight stories high—

00:07:00.680 --> 00:07:04.340
Uh...what was that all of a sudden?

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:10.810
Yes. I decided it would be most efficient
to destroy them all in one swoop.

00:07:12.230 --> 00:07:13.300
Well, that's true but...

00:07:14.250 --> 00:07:16.350
We could have at least seen
what the bad guys had in store for us.

00:07:17.590 --> 00:07:19.450
That was kind of mean.

00:07:25.720 --> 00:07:27.460
Looks like there's a basement.

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:42.500
S-Stop!!

00:07:58.900 --> 00:08:01.120
Hey, Asura Kabuto.

00:08:01.820 --> 00:08:03.340
Are you well?

00:08:03.770 --> 00:08:07.000
It appears you've killed
a bunch of my clones again.

00:08:07.860 --> 00:08:09.200
Satisfied?

00:08:09.470 --> 00:08:10.660
Huh?

00:08:10.740 --> 00:08:12.460
Fool!

00:08:12.550 --> 00:08:15.410
Do I look like I'm satisfied?

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:18.960
I've been kept locked up
deep beneath the Earth.

00:08:19.300 --> 00:08:24.420
I, the strongest warrior in the entire
"House of Evolution."

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:31.590
You are mentally unstable. We couldn't
control you. There was no choice.

00:08:32.340 --> 00:08:34.630
Control me?

00:08:35.590 --> 00:08:37.140
You idiot!

00:08:37.500 --> 00:08:42.140
I am the culmination of the "New Human"
you guys have sought for so long.

00:08:42.420 --> 00:08:47.320
My intelligence and physical strength
and your own are incomparable!

00:08:47.350 --> 00:08:52.400
You should be the ones obeying me.

00:08:54.030 --> 00:08:56.500
No. You're a failure.

00:08:56.600 --> 00:08:58.630
It's true you perform
at unheard of levels,

00:08:58.630 --> 00:09:00.230
but it is humanity you lack.

00:09:01.030 --> 00:09:04.820
Go ahead, kill me.
Plenty of clones could take my place.

00:09:05.510 --> 00:09:06.970
Oh?

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:08.870
But I have a favor to ask first.

00:09:09.460 --> 00:09:11.980
There's a specimen I must have.

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:17.780
He is extremely strong.
Only you can defeat him.

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:20.790
I want you to catch him for me...

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:25.840
...dead or alive.

00:09:28.740 --> 00:09:30.430
This basement is huge!

00:09:30.970 --> 00:09:32.410
I'm getting kind of fired up.

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:36.060
Huh?

00:09:36.650 --> 00:09:38.270
I sense living beings deeper in...

00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:42.970
Master, two of them are approaching.

00:09:46.070 --> 00:09:48.030
Oh, here I come!

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:50.630
There are two. Which one is it?

00:09:50.630 --> 00:09:52.080
The one on the right...

00:09:52.620 --> 00:09:56.190
In that case, you don't need the one
on the left!

00:09:58.110 --> 00:09:58.920
Genos?

00:10:00.670 --> 00:10:01.160
Huh?

00:10:02.730 --> 00:10:03.360
Hey...

00:10:05.480 --> 00:10:08.060
I am Asura Kabuto!

00:10:08.300 --> 00:10:11.770
We got a combat experimentation room.

00:10:11.820 --> 00:10:14.700
Let's do this in there.

00:10:15.100 --> 00:10:17.950
You turned Genos into a piece of
modern art.

00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:20.890
Fight's on!

00:10:29.840 --> 00:10:31.340
Pretty big, eh?

00:10:31.700 --> 00:10:34.620
It's the biggest room in the facility.

00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:40.190
This is where they make us fight
to test our combat abilities.

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:44.370
Well then, let's start the killing—

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:49.150
Oh?

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:51.700
Still alive, huh?

00:11:13.330 --> 00:11:15.660
You fool!

00:11:16.490 --> 00:11:18.160
Machinegun Blows!

00:11:31.530 --> 00:11:32.820
He got me.

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:34.400
Let me...

00:11:35.820 --> 00:11:36.650
...take him...

00:11:37.590 --> 00:11:40.610
Your face is all cracked.
Don't push yourself.

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:50.190
With his breath? Impossible!

00:11:55.370 --> 00:11:57.000
Genos, you okay?

00:11:57.120 --> 00:11:57.910
Yes...

00:12:00.590 --> 00:12:02.800
But, your head doesn't look alright!

00:12:09.710 --> 00:12:13.400
You've gone and gotten my hopes up.

00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:38.820
I have always been critical of humans
and their inferior abilities.

00:12:39.750 --> 00:12:44.350
The entire species, aside from myself,
can be viewed only as dumb animals.

00:12:44.850 --> 00:12:47.020
That realization was agony for me.

00:12:47.840 --> 00:12:51.070
If memory serves right, I was 15
when it occurred to me.

00:12:52.010 --> 00:12:54.470
A plan to evolve
the human animal

00:12:54.710 --> 00:12:57.980
and create a world
where I could live contentedly.

00:12:58.650 --> 00:13:02.360
A utopia of my own, created by me.

00:13:02.940 --> 00:13:04.680
A world made up of only us,

00:13:04.680 --> 00:13:09.010
the new human breed
that will transcend humanity!

00:13:17.890 --> 00:13:19.170
I must see it through.

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:26.140
Compared to my anguish back then,
this physical pain I feel now is nothing.

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:30.360
What's the hold up? Let's go!

00:13:30.360 --> 00:13:31.890
Bring everything you've got.

00:13:33.460 --> 00:13:35.590
Asura Kabuto—a demon incarnate,

00:13:35.650 --> 00:13:38.440
the strongest and most brutal
creation of the House of Evolution.

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:42.540
Let's see how you, at your archaic
stage of human development,

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:45.950
fare against a monster that is
the final form of artificial evolution.

00:13:46.460 --> 00:13:50.700
Or will you be the trigger for
a new evolution?

00:13:52.020 --> 00:13:53.800
I can't wait to find out!

00:13:57.540 --> 00:14:02.230
Oh, I see it. I see it!
You're supposed to be strong.

00:14:02.280 --> 00:14:03.560
Don't disappoint me now.

00:14:04.320 --> 00:14:06.470
You're this place's ultimate weapon, right?

00:14:07.100 --> 00:14:09.340
You're clearly not the same as the guys
from this morning.

00:14:10.050 --> 00:14:12.500
Look at you, just oozing with confidence.

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:18.750
He's fast!

00:14:28.980 --> 00:14:30.070
What are you doing?

00:14:31.540 --> 00:14:32.080
Hey.

00:14:35.610 --> 00:14:36.610
He just backed off?

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:38.960
Asura Kabuto?!

00:14:40.380 --> 00:14:43.180
If I'd attacked him just now,
he'd have killed me.

00:14:44.330 --> 00:14:46.060
Who the hell is this guy?

00:14:46.880 --> 00:14:48.650
He's leaving himself wide open,

00:14:49.230 --> 00:14:53.070
yet all my instincts are screaming,
sending out danger signals!

00:14:53.610 --> 00:14:54.130
Huh?

00:14:54.570 --> 00:14:55.990
You bastard!

00:14:57.290 --> 00:15:02.390
Just how in the
world did you get that strong?

00:15:10.560 --> 00:15:12.320
So you wanna know too?

00:15:13.860 --> 00:15:14.830
Okay, fine.

00:15:17.450 --> 00:15:19.110
Genos, you listen carefully too.

00:15:20.540 --> 00:15:22.410
He's going to tell us right now?

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:25.980
The secret to Master's power...?

00:15:26.370 --> 00:15:27.800
I'd like to know too.

00:15:29.550 --> 00:15:30.090
Huh?

00:15:30.630 --> 00:15:31.270
Who are you?

00:15:31.570 --> 00:15:32.690
I am Genus.

00:15:35.930 --> 00:15:38.780
Well, fine. Listen up.

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:43.460
It's too risky! He can't let
these guys know his secret!

00:15:44.520 --> 00:15:50.090
First, what's important is, to make sure
you stick to this intense training regimen.

00:15:51.420 --> 00:15:55.870
Training? Not modification surgery
or genetic enhancement,

00:15:56.160 --> 00:15:57.380
but training?

00:15:57.790 --> 00:15:59.740
What training...?

00:16:02.210 --> 00:16:03.880
Listen, Genos.

00:16:05.050 --> 00:16:06.280
You just have to keep doing it.

00:16:08.290 --> 00:16:10.020
No matter how hard it gets.

00:16:11.340 --> 00:16:14.010
It took me three years to get this strong.

00:16:15.960 --> 00:16:17.640
One hundred push-ups!

00:16:18.260 --> 00:16:20.120
One hundred sit-ups!

00:16:20.560 --> 00:16:22.270
One hundred squats!

00:16:23.140 --> 00:16:25.160
Then a ten kilometer run.

00:16:25.740 --> 00:16:27.540
Every single day!

00:16:36.570 --> 00:16:39.950
And of course, make sure you eat
three meals a day.

00:16:40.110 --> 00:16:43.240
Just a banana in the morning is fine.
But the most important thing is

00:16:42.880 --> 00:16:48.630
Save Money

00:16:43.560 --> 00:16:46.050
to never use the A/C or heat
in the summer or winter

00:16:46.050 --> 00:16:48.280
so that you can strengthen the mind.

00:16:52.590 --> 00:16:54.730
In the beginning, you'll wish
you were dead.

00:16:55.800 --> 00:16:59.240
You might start thinking
what's the harm of taking a day off?

00:17:00.910 --> 00:17:06.170
But for me, in order to be a strong hero,
no matter how tough it was,

00:17:06.390 --> 00:17:09.000
even if I was spitting blood,
I never stopped.

00:17:10.110 --> 00:17:13.280
I kept doing squats even when my legs
were so heavy they refused to move.

00:17:14.110 --> 00:17:16.820
Even when my arms started making
weird clicking noises,

00:17:16.870 --> 00:17:18.890
I kept doing push-ups.

00:17:20.540 --> 00:17:23.130
A year and a half later, I started
to notice a difference.

00:17:23.570 --> 00:17:25.420
I was bald...

00:17:26.090 --> 00:17:28.140
And I had become stronger!

00:17:29.700 --> 00:17:34.420
In other words, you gotta train like hell
to the point where your hair falls out.

00:17:34.730 --> 00:17:37.600
That's the only way to become strong.

00:17:39.630 --> 00:17:42.150
The guys that are fooling around with

00:17:42.150 --> 00:17:45.900
the "new human race" and evolution junk
will never make it this far.

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:50.030
Human beings are strong because
we have the ability to change ourselves.

00:17:50.810 --> 00:17:52.900
W-What?

00:17:53.440 --> 00:17:55.780
Is this guy...for real?

00:17:56.260 --> 00:17:57.400
Master...

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:00.290
You are so...

00:18:01.820 --> 00:18:03.370
FULL OF CRAP!

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:03.930
Huh?

00:18:04.610 --> 00:18:07.640
That is nothing but
standard strength training!

00:18:08.660 --> 00:18:10.540
And it's not even that intense!

00:18:11.160 --> 00:18:12.560
It's just a normal level!

00:18:13.140 --> 00:18:21.490
I...I have to get stronger. I didn't ask
to study under you just to hear jokes!

00:18:23.260 --> 00:18:25.210
Master Saitama,

00:18:25.650 --> 00:18:28.980
your power is clearly stronger than
what you'd get from just training your body.

00:18:29.080 --> 00:18:32.150
That's right, I want to know your—

00:18:32.150 --> 00:18:34.570
We want to know your true secret!

00:18:36.690 --> 00:18:37.630
Genos...

00:18:39.280 --> 00:18:42.350
You may not believe me,
but that's really all I did.

00:18:43.460 --> 00:18:45.120
Oh yeah?

00:18:49.020 --> 00:18:50.850
No! Asura Kabuto!

00:18:51.610 --> 00:18:55.840
If you don't wanna tell us your secret...
so be it.

00:18:57.330 --> 00:19:00.410
Stop! You'll go on another rampage!

00:19:01.190 --> 00:19:05.060
I bet you aren't stronger than me anyway!

00:19:08.070 --> 00:19:13.070
But, since you pissed me off,

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:15.600
I'm gonna annihilate you.

00:19:17.720 --> 00:19:20.190
ASURA

00:19:17.720 --> 00:19:20.190
MODE

00:19:17.720 --> 00:19:20.190
ASURA

00:19:17.720 --> 00:19:20.190
MODE

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:20.300
Asura Mode!

00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:30.300
When I get like this I lose control
for a whole week

00:19:30.440 --> 00:19:33.080
and my lust for death cannot be quelled!

00:19:33.330 --> 00:19:41.380
After I kill you, I'll head into town and go on
a killing rampage until next Saturday!

00:19:42.570 --> 00:19:46.840
If you are indeed a strong hero,
then try and stop me!

00:20:00.480 --> 00:20:02.680
No way... it can't be.

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:11.710
Master?!

00:20:12.760 --> 00:20:13.530
Dammit.

00:20:14.030 --> 00:20:17.280
I might have made
a horrible mistake.

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:22.300
This guy's in Asura mode...

00:20:23.300 --> 00:20:26.920
He said he'll be on a rampage
for a whole week?

00:20:28.340 --> 00:20:31.270
Death, death, death, death, death, death,

00:20:31.270 --> 00:20:33.570
Death, death, death, death, death!!

00:20:33.570 --> 00:20:36.440
He'll be like this till next Saturday?

00:20:37.490 --> 00:20:39.070
One whole week from today...

00:20:41.000 --> 00:20:42.710
Next Saturday...

00:20:43.690 --> 00:20:47.300
In other words, today
is Saturday too.

00:20:48.420 --> 00:20:49.670
That means...

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:51.910
It's all over.

00:20:52.360 --> 00:20:55.840
There's no one in this world
that can stop him.

00:20:57.260 --> 00:21:00.300
That means...
Today is...

00:21:00.890 --> 00:21:05.670
Bargain day at the supermarket!!

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:18.610
Who the hell is this guy?

00:21:18.730 --> 00:21:21.450
I screwed up!!!

00:21:22.390 --> 00:21:23.740
What is he—

00:21:23.740 --> 00:21:27.500
I'm pretty sure he's upset about this.

00:21:28.450 --> 00:21:31.160

00:21:31.340 --> 00:21:32.980
Master, the store closes at 10:00 PM.

00:21:33.670 --> 00:21:35.800
That is about four hours away.

00:21:36.060 --> 00:21:38.310
If we really hurry, we can make it.

00:21:39.100 --> 00:21:41.180
I'll make it if I hurry?

00:21:41.380 --> 00:21:42.030
Yes!

00:21:42.130 --> 00:21:43.270
Let's go, Genos!

00:21:43.270 --> 00:21:44.300
Yes, Master!

00:21:45.420 --> 00:21:47.010
I think I'm done...

00:21:47.260 --> 00:21:48.880
...with evolution.

00:21:51.300 --> 00:21:52.780
It appears that...

00:21:54.050 --> 00:21:55.710
...I am the one who must change.